<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Built-in creed practices for the thirty CanBeCreed factions not covered by DeepEndgame.

  These are authored minimum lots. generate-lot-realizations.py expands them into ordinary exact
  M/L/XL maps; Qud never synthesises architecture. Geometry follows use: open rings remain open,
  guarded work has controlled throats, wet work drains toward basins, and public trade keeps a
  witness path. The palette is shared only where material truth is shared. Each plan owns a unique
  BuildKey, topology, function anchors, and catalogue behavior.
-->
